# Court witness (2026-10-01 consolidation). Positive fixture: portfolio with policy and two candidate members.
@prefix dfcm: <https://ggen.dev/ontology/dfcm#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .
dfcm:WitnessPortfolio a dfcm:Portfolio ; dfcm:selectionPolicy dfcm:ParetoPolicy ; dfcm:member dfcm:CandidateWitnessA, dfcm:CandidateWitnessB .
dfcm:CandidateWitnessA a dfcm:Candidate .
dfcm:CandidateWitnessB a dfcm:Candidate .
